**Request \[[Create API Key](https://ultracart.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/ucdoc/pages/38688545/API+Simple+Key)\]**
```bash
# assignRma: POST /order/orders/{order_id}/rma (scope: order_write)
# Assigns an RMA number to an order. The rma value is required, max 30 characters, and trimmed.
# Any existing RMA on the order is replaced and a merchant note is added. _expand is optional.
curl -X POST "https://secure.ultracart.com/rest/v2/order/orders/DEMO-0009104390/rma\\ \
?_expand=summary" \
  -H "Accept: application/json" \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -H "X-UltraCart-Api-Version: 2017-03-01" \
  -H "x-ultracart-simple-key: 55f7c4940f843d01a10c5d77f17001009dcc02345e79bd01a10c5d77f1700100" \
  -d $'{
    "rma": "RMA-12345"
}'
```

**Response Body**
```json
{
    "order": {
        "merchant_id": "DEMO",
        "order_id": "DEMO-0009104390",
        "current_stage": "Shipping Department",
        "creation_dts": "2020-09-25T11:48:56-04:00",
        "language_iso_code": "ENG"
    },
    "success": true,
    "metadata": {
        "payload_name": "order"
    }
}
```
